Kerrigan’s difficulties finding shoes continued through high school and college.
At Lake Forest College, where she played basketball, she didn’t mind wearing
athletic shoes and flip-flops, but the lack of fashionable shoes was a problem when
she graduated. She saw herself and her teammates (all tall women) as future
